WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.314
The lasting takeaway is a reframing.

00:00:02.394 --> 00:00:08.631
By posing time series pre-training as
past-to-current reconstruction between Siamese subseries,

00:00:08.711 --> 00:00:14.948
and equipping the model with learnable lineage
embeddings to span different temporal distances,

00:00:15.028 --> 00:00:21.532
TimeSiam captures exactly the correlations that
masking and contrastive methods leave on the table.

00:00:21.612 --> 00:00:26.519
The payoff is a simple, general framework that
drops onto modern backbones,

00:00:26.599 --> 00:00:29.245
scales with larger and more diverse data,

00:00:29.325 --> 00:00:33.900
and sets a new state of the art for transfer across
tasks and domains.
